Vendored verbatim from upstream commit 9ddec3e2db2286a53ff7386345f7e699ad9563f0:

  assets/skills/**             the seven persona skills and their references
  assets/companion/**          the agy companion (Node, standard library only)
  assets/docs/REFERENCE*.md    reference and design docs
  assets/templates/**          task brief templates

Nothing in those files is edited on disk. Two adaptations happen at load time in
index.js, because DeepSeek Harness has no plugin namespace:

  * the frontmatter `name:` is served as `agy-<persona>` (so `/agy` lists all
    seven), and
  * `/agy:` in body prose is rendered as `/agy-`.

